  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Kerygmachela kierkegaardi with eleven pairs of lateral flaps, spiny frontal appendages and one median tail spine. Compressed fossils inform the external arrangement; three-dimensional tissue thickness, pose and colour are reconstructed. The small display scale is illustrative, not an adult maximum; internal neural anatomy is not shown.",
    "zh": "克里马虾 Kerygmachela kierkegaardi 保留十一对侧叶、带刺前附肢与单条中央尾刺。压扁化石约束外部排列，三维软组织厚度、姿态及颜色属复原。展示尺寸为小个体示意，非成年最大值；不显示内部神经结构。"
  },
